<!-- ===================== 1. RECRUIT ===================== -->
<section class="view active" id="recruit">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="eyebrow">On the hunt for our HEROs · Perth-first</span>
    <h1 class="display">Live your life.<br/>Record here and there.<br/>Shoot it through.</h1>
    <p class="lede">HEX Crew is for athletes, runners, lifters, surfers, fighters, FIFO crew and food makers who already live with the product. You don't have to perform — just film what's already happening. Drop the clips into your HEX folder. We do the rest. And keep your eyes on the inbox — we're picking the crew that'll roll with us on in-house works.</p>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goTab('onboarding')">Apply — start the intake <span class="arrow">→</span></button>
      <button type="button" class="btn" style="background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);" onclick="goTab('onboarding')">Start onboarding <span class="arrow">→</span></button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="goTab('quota')">See the quota</button>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);max-width:540px;">Direct line to the founder team. We read every message. We're watching for the HEROs.</div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Your commission</div>
        <div class="stat-n">15–30<small>%</small></div>
        <div class="stat-foot">Per verified sale through your code. Tiers unlock automatically on lifetime sales.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Your audience saves</div>
        <div class="stat-n">20–30<small>%</small></div>
        <div class="stat-foot">A real discount you can shout about. The bigger your tier, the bigger their saving.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Per-mission prizes</div>
        <div class="stat-n">$250–$10k<small>per win</small></div>
        <div class="stat-foot">Every mission carries its own prize. Big PR stunts add named upside — gear, tickets, named SKUs, custom kicks.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Your ideas earn too</div>
        <div class="stat-n">$500–$5k<small>per pitch</small></div>
        <div class="stat-foot">Pitch a mission, activation or collab. If the community votes it up and we ship it — you get paid the value.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:80px;">
      <span class="eyebrow blue">Pick your tribe</span>
      <h2 class="display">Five tribes. Five leaderboards.<br/>Five winners every month.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Compete inside your tribe — not against gym creators if you're a surfer, not against fighters if you're a DJ. Each tribe has its own monthly $1,000 kicker for top three.</p>

      <div class="tribe-row">
        <div class="tribe-card"><div class="tribe-icon"></div><div class="tribe-name">Lift Crew</div><div class="tribe-count">F45 · CrossFit · Strength</div></div>
        <div class="tribe-card"><div class="tribe-icon"></div><div class="tribe-name">Trail Crew</div><div class="tribe-count">Run · Surf · Ocean swim</div></div>
        <div class="tribe-card"><div class="tribe-icon"></div><div class="tribe-name">Combat Crew</div><div class="tribe-count">MMA · BJJ · Boxing</div></div>
        <div class="tribe-card"><div class="tribe-icon"></div><div class="tribe-name">Night Crew</div><div class="tribe-count">DJs · Bars · Music</div></div>
        <div class="tribe-card"><div class="tribe-icon"></div><div class="tribe-name">Grind Crew</div><div class="tribe-count">Tradies · FIFO · Hustlers</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="callout">
      <h3>The deal in three lines.</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">You bring the audience and the content. We bring the product, the missions, the prize pool, and a payment rail that doesn't miss.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>10 clips minimum a month.</strong> No cap. More clips = more shots at every bonus.</li>
        <li><strong>15–30% commission.</strong> Your audience saves 20–30%. Both numbers climb with your tier.</li>
        <li><strong>Spark bonuses + Wildcards.</strong> Random drops, paid-ad bonuses, free shoes, recovery packs, and one $20k major every month.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:80px;">
      <span class="eyebrow green">Common questions</span>
      <h2 class="display">FAQ.</h2>
      <div style="margin-top:40px;">
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">How much can I actually earn per month?</div><div class="faq-a">At Catalyst tier driving 20 orders/month, commission alone is around $560. Add one mission win ($1,500), a pitched idea that got adopted ($1,000), a share of a community mission that landed ($150), and a Wildcard win ($500) — you're at $3,710+ in a normal month. Top Reactors clear $10–15k some months. The path to bigger numbers is missions and pitches, not chasing views.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">What do you mean by HEROs?</div><div class="faq-a">HEX Crew has a higher tier above Reactor that we don't list publicly: HEROs. These are the creators we're picking to roll with us on in-house work — sponsored athlete contracts, paid shoots, content director gigs, named SKU launches, equity. We pick HEROs from inside the existing Crew based on how they show up over time. Apply through Crew first.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">How do I log in and submit content?</div><div class="faq-a">Use the native Shopify customer sign-in. Shopify emails a one-time verification code. For content, upload your files to Drive, Dropbox or WeTransfer, then paste the shared link into the onboarding form. Direct file storage is not connected yet.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">How do I contact HEX?</div><div class="faq-a">Use the onboarding or pitch form. Each sends the details to the HEX store contact inbox. Affiliate account questions remain in the separate GoAffPro portal.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">How do pitches and community missions work?</div><div class="faq-a">Signed-in customers can send a pitch through the native Shopify form. It arrives in the HEX contact inbox for review. Voting and automatic board publishing are not connected yet. Community missions remain part of the programme model until the workflow is configured.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">Where do affiliate earnings appear?</div><div class="faq-a">Current referral reporting is in the HEX GoAffPro portal. The payout timing, tier ladder and any bonus settlement rules must be finalised in GoAffPro before they can be described as live.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">What's the 10-clip quota for?</div><div class="faq-a">Volume + variety is what makes the algorithm move. 10 distinct use cases per month gives us — and you — enough surface area to find what cuts through. The 10 are spelled out on the Monthly Quota tab. Post more than 10 if you want — there's no cap, and every extra clip is another chance at a viral kicker, a Spark bonus or a Wildcard.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">What happens if I don't hit 10?</div><div class="faq-a">First miss: friendly nudge from your Crew lead. Two missed months in a row: you drop a tier. Three: removal. We need creators who post, not creators who collected a sample box and went quiet. That's the deal both ways.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">Do I need a huge following?</div><div class="faq-a">No follower minimum to apply as a Recruit. Higher tiers unlock as you drive sales — not as you grow followers. We've watched 800-follower micro-creators out-earn 80k macros because their tribe converts.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">What happens if HEX hits trouble?</div><div class="faq-a">Creator payouts sit in a ring-fenced trust account separate from operating cash. Even if HEX hits a wall, earned commissions are protected. This is a hard rule — we built it after watching Bang Energy creators go unpaid through bankruptcy.</div></div>
        <div class="faq"><div class="faq-q">What about ACCC disclosure?</div><div class="faq-a">Every post under a HEX mission must show #ad or #HEXpartner before the fold. We run automated compliance scans. Three undisclosed posts ends the partnership.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

